- ✅ Module 2.3: Rendering Strategies
- ✅ Module 2.4: Building the Home Page
- ⏳ Module 3: Database & Data Layer (pending)
- ⏳ Module 4: Authentication & Security (pending)

## Notes for AI Assistants
- This is an educational project focused on learning
- Code quality and best practices are prioritized
- Comments should explain "why" not "what"
- Demo code should be clearly marked as such
